{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Einherjar's Ascent</strong> is a Norse-themed survivor roguelite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may have already died, but for the Einherjar, that's only the beginning. Awaken in Valhalla, collect runes for Mimir, and unlock powerful abilities as you prepare for Ragnarok itself. Travel across the Nine Realms\u2014from Midgard to Helheim\u2014battling endless hordes (yes, there\u2019s a counter) and uncovering ancient secrets to aid your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight. Upgrade. Repeat. The cycle of glory awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Unlock and upgrade abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Unlock multiple Norse-inspired characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Explore the realms and uncover their secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Collect runes to buy permanent upgrades\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Face off against relentless hordes from the darkest corners of the Nine Realms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Survive for Odin!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Unlocked Helheim","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2877010/0d60d6e4b4ab208eef4398d3b85ca7536f21eee7.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Ragnar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2877010/910e3314e4179c05a27cf257a91a806ac0ae8fd7.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Surtr","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2877010/f6585e02101faae2f35cc0de50593a5879d50512.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Brokkr","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2877010/b77c420c52c4573fdf01405d2d008c3d202b9358.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat The Rootbound","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2877010/b1ff2e95f9511bc3c762854dc439658c2330dbef.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Thrym","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2877010/8